OL,3,GNEWSAAlert as fire destroys roof of    
OL,4,Aproperty                               
OL,6,FResidents were warned to keep doors and
OL,7,Fwindows closed as a fire engulfed the  
OL,8,Froof of a large property in West Sussex
OL,9,Fon Saturday evening.                   
OL,11,FThe fire broke out shortly before 20:20
OL,12,FGMT at a large detached two-storey     
OL,13,Fproperty on Bucks Green in Rudgwick.   
OL,15,FImages taken from the scene show the   
OL,16,Froof completely destroyed as smoke     
OL,17,Fbillowed from what remains of the      
OL,18,Fbuilding's structure.                  
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
