OL,3,GNEWSAAlert as fire destroys roof of    
OL,4,Aproperty                               
OL,6,FFirefighters were hosing water into the
OL,7,Fproperty from an aerial ladder platform
OL,8,Fparked to the rear nearby, and from    
OL,9,Ffire engines in front of the building. 
